        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Open viewing at 10.15am on Saturday 3rd October - please email to register\r\n\r\nMadden Property Consultants are delighted to present this bright and well-presented two-bedroom apartment in the highly sought-after Castleforbes Square development, in the north Docklands.\r\n\r\nSituated on the fourth floor, this attractive apartment enjoys a west-facing aspect and benefits from a large balcony, providing an excellent outdoor space and plenty of natural light throughout the afternoon and evening.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious open-plan living, kitchen and dining area, creating a contemporary and versatile space ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.  The kitchen has been renovated to an exceptional level.  There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, both facing onto an internal courtyard and a large family bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe property has also benefited from an upgraded heating system and achieves a B3 BER rating, offering a good balance of comfort and energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nA further significant benefit is the provision of designated parking, adding convenience and peace of mind for residents.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a well-appointed apartment offering bright, modern accommodation, generous outdoor space and secure parking in a popular Dublin development. The property would appeal to first-time buyers, owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nHallway - 5sqm\r\nWooden floors, intercom\r\n\r\nLiving/dining room - 21sqm\r\nWooden floors, ceiling heating panel, direct access to west facing balcony\r\n\r\nKitchen - 6sqm\r\nFully renovated, integrated units, island\r\n\r\nMaster double bedroom - 15sqm\r\nFloor to ceiling windows, facing internal courtyard, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nDouble bedroom - 12 sqm\r\nFloor to ceiling windows, facing internal courtyard, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom - 5sqm\r\nBath, partially tiled, WC & WHB\r\n\r\nBalcony - 8sqm\r\nWest facing"
      },
      {
